    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "\"make it quiet for yourself\"... what do you mean by that? i feel like i'm just constantly fighting an incoming tide. i've tried everything to fix things or even just find some peace, but it's like the harder i struggle, the more i drown. is there actually any way out of this besides just giving up?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
